I'd really got me, I really blanked, and I was thinking as I was watching it, like, oh, this one right is kind of a late, farcical episode, and I wanna ask you about what it was like to play that, but like, I, the ending really got me.
我真的明白了，我真的茫然了，我在看的时候就在想，哦，这一集有点迟了，闹剧，我想问你玩这个是什么感觉，但是，我，结局真的让我着迷。

