00:21:08.690 --> 00:21:33.849
And I think that, I think that, how I met your mother was really good about not, I mean, in some ways it's a kind of urban fantasy, but at the same time it was really trying to ground itself in the facts of relationships, but the bumpiness of relationships, the almost impossibility of like communicating with people and then finding a way through it.
我认为，我认为，我如何遇见你母亲真的很好，我的意思是，在某些方面，这是一种都市幻想，但同时它确实试图将自己扎根于关系的事实中，但关系的坎坷，几乎不可能与人交流，然后找到解决办法。

00:21:33.849 --> 00:21:35.730
Yeah, I agree.
